      "interpretation": "DRE% was calculated for the sum of 12 target PFAAs based on influent versus liquid and gaseous effluent PFAA mass flows, yielding >99.999% reduction after two ~120-min continuous-flow SCWO trials. This endpoint reflects near-complete loss of the targeted parent PFAAs but does not by itself distinguish between transformation to other organic fluorinated products and full mineralization.",
