      "interpretation": "An energy efficiency metric (EEM) of 1.1\u00d710^5 kW\u00b7h/kg PFAS was calculated for the SCWO system under the tested conditions, representing electrical energy consumption per unit mass of PFAS treated. This is an operational performance endpoint rather than a direct chemical fate measure.",
      "reported_term": "energy efficiency metric (EEM)"
    },
    {
      "endpoint_type": "other",
      "evidence_locator_ids": [
        "S09-E02"
      ],
      "interpretation": "An increase of 3.8%\u201350.8% in the sum of short-chain PFAAs (\u03a3PFAA SC) was observed in some cases. The authors state that the available data do not allow them to distinguish whether this increase reflects incomplete mineralization of fluorotelomer- or precursor-like species (\u03a3PFAALC) or comparatively less effective SCWO of sulfonamide/sulfonate-like short-chain species (\u03a3PFAASC), indicating formation or persistence of certain transformation products even as long-chain target PFAAs are largely removed.",
      "reported_term": "increase in short-chain PFAAs (\u03a3PFAA SC)"
    }
  ],
